  unitName: Silver Knight Joshua
  unitId: 850858
  unitNumber: 8617
  description: The young commander of the 30th Division of the Demon Slayers, the
    Order of Light. Joshua is the youngest man to ever become commander in the history
    of Akras Summoners' Hall. He accrued so many accomplishments during his rookie
    years that it proved impossible to keep track of all them. The day he was assigned
    to a certain Demon Slayers' reconnaissance mission and returned to headquarters
    having slayed the demon all by himself, not even Elder Summoner Karl could hide
    his amazement. Although his skill cannot be denied, his rash behavior and abrasive
    manner of speaking tend to isolate him from everyone else.After being made commander,
    he successfully completed even more crucial missions one after another. No matter
    how difficult the situation is, Joshua always manages to overcome it in his own
    way. He garnered the respect of those around him, who dubbed him "Joshua of Sanjelo".
    So far none of the other young Summoners in Summoners' Hall have been able to
    prove themselves his equal, and thus he is being highly considered for a position
    as a Summoner of Old in the near future.When a mysterious military force began
    its attack, Joshua was called back from a mission in the dangerous and demon-ridden
    land of Ishgria. He rushed into the scene and ambushed its commander, effectively
    stopping their invasion on the Imperial Capital. Joshua continued to fell foe
    after foe in his own independent and rash way, and although this caused quite
    the headache for the Summoners of Old from time to time, he was forgiven because
    he always yields the desired resilts. There is no one who can deny that Joshua's
    skill is the best display of power that Akras Summoners' Hall has to offer.
  summonDesc: I've been waiting for you.<br>Let's go, I'll protect you.<br>After
    all, that was the mission assigned to me.
  fusionDesc: One should focus their power on a single point, then strike with all
    their might.<br>It seems your mind works the same way.<br>Good. Keep it up.
  evoDesc: Many admire Elder Summoner Karl.<br>I guess even innate talent cannot
    flourish without experience.<br>There's still much to learn from him.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
